      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Severe form of HCV infection complicated by early liver failure was reported after solid organ transplantation and described as fibrosing cholestatic hepatitis (FCH). We highlight the need for early detection and possible treatment in this rare but often fatal complication of HCV infection."},
